{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"easter_eggs/menu_15010360:1:1","lang":"jp","texts":{"menu:10051930:1":{"text":"あの部屋を、本当にやらなきゃいけないのかよ……？","source_cn":"我们必须要清理那间屋子吗……？","status":"matched_runtime_gender_keys_same"},"say:2:1536032001:0":{"text":"あれ……あの家屋だ。そう、俺が指差してる先の。","source_cn":"就是……就是那间房子。对，就是我手指的那间。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAE95E69E4CCF4A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1536032002:0":{"text":"少し近づいただけで変な腐敗臭がして……それだけでただ事じゃないって思ったんだ……まさか中が、あんなことに……","source_cn":"刚凑近点，闻到一股子奇怪的腐臭味的时候，我就知道没好事...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x682689210A149F6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1536032003:0":{"text":"中にあったのはすべて……兵士の死体だ。しかも誰ひとり原型をとどめちゃいない。バラバラにされてたり、喰いちぎられてたり……","source_cn":"里面全都是其他士兵的……尸体，可没有一具是完整的。有的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0690CD75C1ABA0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1536032004:0":{"text":"その中に一人、扉にもたれかかるようにして死んでいる兵士がいたんだが……彼の胸には無数の虫の卵が……","source_cn":"有个靠着门死的士兵，他的怀里……怀里还抱着无数的虫卵……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x166480F78025F645","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1536032005:1":{"text":"オェ……も、もう思い出させないでくれ……","source_cn":"快、快别说了……呕……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28C4361017AD6084","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","v